You're not taking the square root of the sum of the squares of x, y, and z. You're just dividing the components by the sum of x, y, and z. This means you're just dividing by the length of the vector. You want the square root of that sum. So the first line of your function should be:

double len = sqrt(x*x + y*y + z*z);


